    "essence": "Reaching toward the peak you can see from where you stand.",
    "light": "Ambition is the part of you that looks at the mountain and wants to climb it. It gives direction to effort and shape to dreams. Plainly put: a desire to grow, achieve or contribute beyond where you are now, and the willingness to work for it. Healthy ambition says \"I can become more,\" not \"I am not enough.\"",
    "shadow": "Too much, and every summit only reveals a higher one. Worth becomes tied to achievement, and rest feels like falling behind. You might climb past the people you love without noticing.",
